@startuml Sequence_Command
title Отправка команды устройству (set_temperature)

actor User
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "Command Service" as CMD
database "Command DB" as DB
participant "Mosquitto" as MQTT
participant "IoT Device" as DEV

User -> GW: POST /api/v1/commands\n{device_id, action, params}
GW -> CMD: Forward request

CMD -> DB: INSERT command (status=pending)
DB --> CMD: command_id

CMD -> CMD: Update status = "sent"
CMD -> MQTT: Publish to\ndevices/{device_id}/commands

MQTT -> DEV: Message: command payload
DEV -> DEV: Execute command\n(set temperature = 25)
DEV -> MQTT: Publish to\ncommands/ack\n{command_id, status=executed}

MQTT -> CMD: Message: ack payload
CMD -> DB: UPDATE status = "executed",\nexecuted_at = NOW()

CMD --> GW: 201 Created\n{command_id, status: "sent"}
GW --> User: Response

note right of DEV
  Устройство выполняет команду
  и отправляет подтверждение
end note

@enduml
